WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.030
A month's passed since I had Efil join me.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.100
Dark
Purple
Forest

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:07.440
We spent it leveling up and doing jobs.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.500
Efil used all her points
on Archery and Far Seeing,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.150
and learned Sewing when she leveled up.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.160
The maid outfit she's wearing
now is her third creation,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.670
which she resewed and enhanced many
times to make it useful for combat.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.520
I took a blacksmithing skill, too.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.580
I'm still practicing, though.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.600
Gerard, get back!

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.610
Blaze Arrow!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:39.430
The combination of her high-level
archery skill, red magic,

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:43.010
and Fire Dragon King's Grace gave
her that original technique.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.220
I'm amazed you can fight like
that dressed as a maid.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.200
Black Summoner

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.470
Wicked Sagetree kill confirmed!

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.820
Another successful job!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.110
That makes nine in a row!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:33.240
One more job, and you can
take the rank-up exam!

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.080
You'll be Rank A soon, Master!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:40.620
And you just became Rank C,
but soon you'll be Rank B!

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:42.880
But...

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:49.870
I felt bad for your opponent in
the mock battle during the last exam.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.270
Efil

00:02:51.810 --> 00:03:02.280
Efil's Rank C Exam

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.270
Examiner

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:55.570
Her arrow scored a clean
hit on the examiner's head

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.310
Here I go!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.320
Skill "Stealth" Activates

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.760
just a second or two
after the fight started.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.350
He was so wide-open I thought
it was some kind of test!

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:06.620
Urd, the examiner, is a veteran
with a lot of experience.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.320
You two are just really strong!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:15.370
Oh, Efil! There's a new sweets
place that just opened.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:16.090
Want to come with?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.050
Yes, I'd love to.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.360
Really? Great!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.650
It's a promise.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.460
Okay!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:28.260
You switched straight from
professional to personal mode...

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.420
You'll go, too, won't you, Master?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.330
I'm going, too?

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.830
Yes, if you can...

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:41.810
Kelvin, you're not going to turn down a
girl who's asking you like that, are you?

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.910
Got it.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.280
I'll go with you tomorrow, if that's okay.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.880
Great!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.590
Ange, do your work.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.450
It's almost like a date...

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.420
No, it is<i> a date!</i>

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.080
To a sweets shop, too!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.790
If Melfina was here,
she might get on my case.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.760
She left my Servant Network this morning,

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.900
saying she was going to go
give a divine oracle...

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:15.210
Hey, Kelvin!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.940
Hello, Ange.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.130
You look great in that outfit.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.380
Thank you.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.860
Huh? Where's Efil?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.830
She said it would take her time to
get ready and to go on without her.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.150
She's going all-out for this.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.220
All-out?

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.230
Um, Kelvin.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:38.710
What?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.010
Why don't you relax a bit around me?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.440
Now that we're hanging out, and all.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.180
Got it.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.720
It'll be easier for me, too.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.210
Is this better, Ange?

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.680
It's fine, Kelvin!

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:57.270
Sorry! I'm here!

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.580
U-Um...

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.630
What do you think?

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:17.310
Um, it doesn't look weird on me, does it?

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:20.730
Come on, Kelvin!

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.390
No, it looks great!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.740
Efil, you're too cute!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.400
That's not true!

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.590
You were just skin and bones a month ago,

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:37.800
but now you're nice and plump...

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.810
Hey, don't pinch me there!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.660
You're growing up too much!

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.370
Nice choices.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:46.800
Thanks.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.040
Efil's looks good, too.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.950
Here you go, Master.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.300
W-Wait, not in public...

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:57.200
Kelvin, you mean you've been having
Efil feed you at home all this time?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.090
That's Ange from the guild,
and Efil the maid, right?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.940
And the new kid who's already a Rank B!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.760
Damn it! He's got two girls with him!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:10.170
No, it's when I'm tasting
her cooking at the inn...

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.770
Did I do something strange?

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:14.950
I can't let her beat me!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:17.640
Here, Kelvin! Say "aah"!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.990
No! Why are you acting like her rival?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:23.380
Hey, are they fighting over him?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.650
A love triangle? A love triangle?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.690
Ange finally found a man!

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:32.850
Girls, let's eat these sweets later.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.670
I can take them back to the inn...

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:38.170
H-He's taking them home?!

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.160
No!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:44.030
Commoners shouldn't be engaging
in romance in public places!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.820
What the heck?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:52.260
Um, what's this about?

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.870
Kneel, worm!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:57.300
This is Tabra, third prince of Trycen.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.840
Trycen?

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.300
A big military country to the east.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:06.220
My Prince, as his social superior,
don't you need to educate him properly?

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:10.390
Lowborns like him must
be put in their place.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.820
I see. That's right.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:17.600
Those women are rather attractive.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:21.210
And the elf's a slave?

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:26.160
If the girls will give themselves to me,
I'll forgive your crimes.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.010
I'm a kind man, you see.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:32.980
K-Kelvin?

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.270
Do you have a problem?

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.390
So both the flunkies are about Rank D, huh?

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:45.730
You would resist me?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:50.270
I'm the third prince of Trycen, Tabra!

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:52.870
I can't move!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:57.340
So what brings you to Parth, Prince?

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:00.370
N-None of your business!

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.270
Fine, I'll answer you!

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:07.550
I came to meet Leo at
the Adventurer's Guild.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.430
Leo?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.760
I've heard a powerful adventurer
has started using Parth as a base.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:19.230
I've come to investigate the
rumors myself, personally.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:23.040
You've got weak guards,
for a prince on a journey.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.850
Trycen believes that talent is everything!

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:32.150
Those with talent rule, which means
there's no place for me at all!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.940
Um, so that means...

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.660
He's a dimwit.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:43.030
I planned on making a powerful adventurer
serve me so I could earn some glory!

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.830
Do you understand now?

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:49.140
By the way, that adventurer's probably me.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:50.200
What?

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.590
But yes, your power's the real thing!

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:56.040
Surely you'll serve under me—

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.200
Yeah, no.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.070
Thanks, Kelvin!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:04.520
You were really cool!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.030
We got interrupted. Let's go buy some more.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:08.890
Yeah!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:11.980
This time, I'll feed you, Kelvin!

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.960
No, thank you!

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.790
Don't blush!

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.740
Stop it! I mean it!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.290
Holy
Empire
of
Deramis
Great
Cathedral

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:26.570
Please, reveal yourself again,

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.980
Goddess Melfina...

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.550
Oh, Melfina!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.860
It's been a long time, Colette.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:41.460
How are the heroes doing?

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.510
Look at this!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.690
Name: Toya Kanzaki
Level: 53
Title: Hero from Another World

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.690
Name: Setsuna Shiga
Level: 52
Title: Hero from Another World

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.690
Name: Miyabi Kuromiya
Level: 53
Title: Hero from Another World

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.890
They're growing splendidly, I see!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.350
Yes, please grant us your oracle...

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:01.010
I sense an evil presence
from the Western Continent.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:03.530
Send the heroes there.

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:06.530
And keep them away from Parth.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.280
Parth...?

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:11.420
Y-Yes, I understand!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:16.070
I'm counting on you, priestess of Deramis!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.480
Colette, what happened?

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:28.350
The Goddess gave us a new oracle, heroes!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:36.190
Master, are you awake?

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.310
Yeah. What's up?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.190
You can't sleep?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:46.290
Thank you for saving me today.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.760
Stop saying that. It's fine.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:55.260
Anyway, I'm sorry we're still
sleeping in the same bed.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:58.840
I keep asking Claire for a new room, but...

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:03.860
Um, Master...

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:08.570
Am I not attractive as a woman?

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.150
Efil?

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:18.060
Master, I... uh...

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.260
No, no, no!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.530
You should really only do that
with the man you love...

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.810
I love you!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:28.350
As a Master! As a man! I love you!
More than anything!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.830
I was cursed to never
be able to touch anyone!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:37.130
And you're the one who taught
me about human warmth!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:39.480
Efil...

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:56.600
You're cute, and more attractive
than any girl I know.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:00.030
Master... Do you really...

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.310
Yeah.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.990
A house. Let's buy a house.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.690
A house with separate rooms for both of us.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.540
I won't survive otherwise.

