00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:25.730
So these are the heroes?

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.380
Here you are. I've brought more...

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:36.220
Is Melfina back?

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.530
Thanks, Clo.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:46.700
Having a small Clotho on your shoulder
lets you participate in the servant network.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:45.050
Yes, I just got back!

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.710
Welcome back!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:52.040
You know, for heroes,
they don't look all that strong.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.030
Heroes?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.840
Their levels aren't that high.

