00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:05.860
Yeah. To be honest, I was expecting
heroes to be at least level 100.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.190
They were summoned a year ago, right?

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.890
What have they been doing?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.670
I'm a little disappointed, too.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:17.590
Will they make it in time for
the Demon King's revival?

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:22.490
You guys are getting much stronger, though!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:27.730
Yeah. My Blacksmithing skill's gone way up!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.740
Wicked Sagetree Staff (Rank A)

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:30.760
Only after a lot of failed creations, though.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:35.040
Well, I've got a plan for them!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:40.230
But you were right to be
proud of this Dreadnought.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:42.420
Dreadnought (Rank A)

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.020
It's incredible.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:46.250
And this Crimson Cape,

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.420
Crimson Cape (Rank B)

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.200
and your robe.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:54.430
Sage's Black Robe (Rank B)

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.780
I made it with my Sewing skill.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.460
You guys are doing great.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:14:00.060
I wish Deramis's knights were
even half as strong as you.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.400
Kel, you in there?

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.780
The guild's calling you.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:12.780
Name: Kelvin
Level: 42 Title: Hero of Parth
HP: 427/427
MP: 890/890
Age: 23 | Strength: 83
Race: Human| Endurance: 87
Sex: Male | Agility: 261
Class: Summoner | Magic: 474
Luck: 349
Skills:
Summoning (Rank S) Spaces: 7 | Double Growth Rate
Green Magic (Rank F) | Double Skill Points
Appraising Eye (Rank S) |  Experience Sharing

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:12.780
Black Summoner

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.800
A demon?

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:20.770
Yes, witnessed in a Rank D
dungeon, the Hermit's Cave.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:25.270
Adventurers exploring it found
a secret room, you see.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:27.250
And there it was.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:31.880
Demons are one of the strongest races,
along with dragons and angels.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.350
I'm surprised they made it back alive.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.670
It seemed to be sealed.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:41.450
But that doesn't mean we
can go messing with it.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:47.230
To tell the truth, I wasn't sure
about asking for your help.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:52.830
The demon's strength is unknown.
Worst case, this could be a Rank S quest.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.320
A demon's strength varies greatly
depending on the individual.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:01.050
Even the weakest are around Rank B, I think?

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:08.500
By the way, Kelvin, I was told you
met Prince Tabra from Trycen.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:13.430
Maybe I did? Maybe I didn't?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.310
Really?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:23.440
I don't know who it was, but some
ruffian assaulted a prince!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:26.400
I'm having a devil of a time cleaning it up.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:30.870
It's on the verge of becoming an
international incident with Trycen.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.320
Oh, I'm afraid we got off topic.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.620
Will you accept this job?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.200
Yes, with pleasure!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.340
You're the demon!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.750
Rank
D
Dungeon
Hermit's
Hollow

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.210
Hey, Kelvin!

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.390
Urd!

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:59.150
You doing well, Efil?
I haven't seen you since your exam.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.360
Yes, good to see you.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.880
And the knight?

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:08.190
I'm Gerard, a friend of Kelvin's.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.850
I've come to offer what help I can.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:13.580
Glad to have you!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.990
So what are we looking at?

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:20.210
As you can see, we've erected a barrier
around the hut and are monitoring it carefully.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:22.340
There's no telling how
effective a Crossvide's

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.950
going to be against a demon, though.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:28.190
Probably useless against anything
stronger than a Rank B demon.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:34.680
As much as I hate to say it,
at our level all we can do is watch.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:38.710
You guys keep watch.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.960
We'll go check out the demon.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.160
Lamvent.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.870
Stay sharp down there.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.670
You take the lead, Gerard.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.280
Efil and I will stay behind.

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.510
Clotho, you bring up the rear.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.600
Indeed.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.600
Okay!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:11.410
We've walked quite a ways...

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.900
But I don't see any monsters.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.870
Something may be up.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.540
I don't sense any life at all,
let alone monsters.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.820
Is this it?

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:28.080
My Lord...

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.970
Something wrong?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:33.130
I sense two life forms in the room.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:37.720
One's probably the demon.
It's badly weakened.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:42.900
The real threat may be the other one.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.820
What do we do with the demon?

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.320
The seal's still intact.
We'll deal with it later.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.340
We'll deal with the other one first.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.530
We may be able to make it
my servant, if we're lucky!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.940
How very strange.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:26.790
Welcome, welcome!

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:32.790
I am the Archdemon Victor!

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:35.660
A pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.050
An Archdemon?

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:43.150
If lesser demons are around Rank B,
then a greater demon like him must be...

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:49.220
What's wrong? Is something funny?

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:50.690
No.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.020
His bad habit's showing again.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.810
So? Who's the girl?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.330
This girl is...

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.970
The Demon King's daughter.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:15.200
My Lord, there have been three
Demon Kings in the past.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:19.460
If it's the most recent, she would be
the daughter of Demon King Gustav.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:22.110
But as far as I know...

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:28.320
I thought Demon King Gustav
didn't have a daughter.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:33.700
Not officially. He had a
great deal of enemies,

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:36.690
and kept her existence a secret.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:41.080
I'm lucky that a powerful
human came so soon!

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:45.590
It was a good idea to let the ones
who found this place escape.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:51.950
I killed every monster in the area,
so I bet it was easy to get here, huh?

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:56.130
I see. So we walked into your trap.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:20:01.930
Yes. To tell the truth,
only humans can break that seal.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.840
So you want us to break her chains?

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:07.990
No, I wouldn't ask for that.

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:08.840
But you see...

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:13.940
I want you to let me eat you,
so I can absorb your power!

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.120
His power...

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:29.880
My unique skill, Gluttony, lets me steal
the characteristics of those I eat.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:34.640
And it's more effective the deeper
the relationship I have with them.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:38.780
I see. So that's why you're so talkative?

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:43.240
You want to eat us, get the characteristic
"human," and break the seal...

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.720
then bring her back as the new Demon King!

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:55.090
I'm afraid that's only half right.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.560
You really <i>are</i> a glutton.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:03.700
That's right. I'm Victor the Glutton.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:08.610
I was the aide to Sera,
daughter of Demon King Gustav.

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:12.700
She is in a way, my daughter!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.700
And if I eat her,
I'll become incredibly powerful!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:19.470
I'll become the new Demon King!

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:24.460
So this is the power of
a Rank S monster, huh?

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:29.180
I've been wondering...
What's that look on your face?

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:33.090
I've never met an enemy as strong as you!

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.980
I'm so excited I can't control myself!

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.410
Fascinating.

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:43.030
Your bad habit's showing.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.460
Um, bad habit?

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:51.930
Efil, when I fought the king, do you
know what look he had on his face?

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:55.000
He was laughing.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.190
In the face of dire peril
and overwhelming power,

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.750
he can't control himself.

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.000
You mean...

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:10.010
EP 04: Demon

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.840
He's a hardcore battle junkie!
